00:29:55,540 --> 00:30:00,040
猫の 名前は なんとなくタマで 犬の 名前は なんとなくポチだ
The cat's name is somehow Tama, the dog's name is somehow Pochi.

239
00:30:06,020 --> 00:30:09,170
生きてる意味も 頑張る意味も
The meaning of living, the meaning of trying hard,

240
00:30:09,820 --> 00:30:12,840
ないないない 無駄かもしれない
none at all, maybe it's all pointless.

241
00:30:13,280 --> 00:30:17,110
千年後 何も残らないけど
A thousand years from now nothing will remain,

242
00:30:17,390 --> 00:30:21,100
それでも君と笑っていたい
but still, I want to smile with you.

243
00:30:21,370 --> 00:30:28,048
VERY EXPECTED TO BE HERE

244
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:38,300
月が昇る 星が光る 虫が跳ねる それを見てる
The moon rises, stars shine, bugs leap, I watch them.

245
00:30:38,670 --> 00:30:41,640
あれ いつからここにいるんだっけ いつまで ここいられるんだっけ
Hey, since when have I been here? How long can I stay here?

246
00:30:42,270 --> 00:30:46,380
何者にもなれないままで 化物から逃れてるだけ
Just running away from monsters without ever becoming anyone special.

247
00:30:46,620 --> 00:30:49,180
座敷牢でイメージを浮かべて ストップした思考は敵だらけ
Conjuring images in a cell, my stopped thoughts are surrounded by enemies.

248
00:30:49,700 --> 00:30:53,380
太郎の 名前は 今でも太郎で 次郎の 名前は 今では花子だ
Taro's name is still Taro, Jiro's name is now Hanako.

249
00:30:53,560 --> 00:30:56,930
時間は 時間は なんとなく通り過ぎて
Time, time just passes by somehow,

250
00:30:57,410 --> 00:31:00,720
ゴミ溜めで埋もれたまま 星空を眺めてるよ
buried in a pile of garbage, gazing up at the starry sky.

251
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:04,190
愛する意味も 恋する意味も ないないない 嘘かもしれない
The meaning of love, the meaning of romance, none, maybe it's all a lie.

252
00:31:04,450 --> 00:31:07,770
１＋１も よくわからんけど それでも君を守っていたい
Even if I don't quite understand 1+1, still, I want to protect you.

253
00:31:08,020 --> 00:31:11,500
ぼくらはみんな意味不明だから
Because we're all incomprehensible,

254
00:31:11,800 --> 00:31:15,390
ぼくらはみんな意味不明だから
because we're all incomprehensible.

255
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:19,060
それでもぼくらは トンネルで息を止める
Even so, we hold our breath in tunnels.

256
00:31:19,390 --> 00:31:23,280
折り紙で鶴を折る 肉球を触る
Fold paper cranes, touch paw pads.

257
00:31:23,560 --> 00:31:27,150
横断歩道の白い部分だけを踏む
Step only on the white parts of pedestrian crossings.

258
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:30,450
それでもぼくらは 間違ったことをする
Even so, we do wrong things,

259
00:31:30,730 --> 00:31:35,080
頭いいから わかっていた また わかった気になっていたんだ
thinking we were smart enough to know, fooling ourselves into thinking we understood.

260
00:31:35,300 --> 00:31:43,048
VERY EXPECTED TO BE HERE

261
00:31:49,848 --> 00:31:53,048
生きてる意味も頑張る意味も
The meaning of living, the meaning of trying hard,

262
00:31:53,248 --> 00:31:56,548
ないないないないないないない
there's none, none, none at all...

263
00:31:56,848 --> 00:31:59,548
それでもやるしかない
Even so, we have no choice but to do it.

264
00:32:00,048 --> 00:32:03,248
生きてる意味も頑張る意味も
The meaning of living, the meaning of trying hard,

265
00:32:03,448 --> 00:32:06,348
ないないない無駄かもしれない
none at all, maybe it's all pointless.

266
00:32:06,548 --> 00:32:09,048
千年後何も残らないけど
A thousand years from now nothing will remain,

267
00:32:09,248 --> 00:32:12,348
それでも君と笑っていたい
but still, I want to smile with you.

268
00:32:12,648 --> 00:32:17,548
夢を叶えても悟り開いても結局は孤独かもしれない
Even if dreams come true, even if we attain enlightenment, we might still end up lonely.

269
00:32:17,848 --> 00:32:24,548
おばけになっても虚無に還ってもそれでも君と笑っていたいな
Even if we become ghosts, even if we return to nothingness, still, I want to smile with you.

270
00:32:25,048 --> 00:32:35,048
ぼくらはみんな意味不明だから…
Because we're all incomprehensible...

271
00:33:06,248 --> 00:33:09,548
そう簡単な祈りだった
It was such a simple prayer.

272
00:33:09,748 --> 00:33:13,248
端からだんだんと消える感嘆
Fading away edge by edge, a vanishing exclamation.

273
00:33:13,448 --> 00:33:16,848
今から緞帳が上がるから
Since the curtain is about to rise now,

274
00:33:17,048 --> 00:33:20,048
静かな会場を後にさようなら
goodbye, leaving the quiet venue behind.

275
00:33:21,048 --> 00:33:35,048
VERY EXPECTED TO BE HERE

276
00:33:35,548 --> 00:33:38,048
言いかけていた事が一つ消えて
Something I was about to say vanished,

277
00:33:38,248 --> 00:33:41,248
また増えて背中に後ろめたさが残る
and more guilt remains piled up on my back.

278
00:33:42,048 --> 00:33:45,548
従いたい心根を吐き出さぬように込めて
Bottling up my obedient heart so it won't spill out,

279
00:33:45,848 --> 00:33:48,548
胸の中が澱のように濁る
my chest grows murky like sediment.

280
00:33:49,048 --> 00:33:52,248
受け止めたいことが自分さえ抱えられず
Unable to even embrace what I want to accept,

281
00:33:52,548 --> 00:33:55,548
持て余したそれを守っている
I'm just protecting that excess weight.

282
00:33:56,048 --> 00:33:59,048
霞んだ声はからからに
My hazy voice is bone dry,

283
00:33:59,348 --> 00:34:02,348
喉を焼いて埋め尽くす
burning my throat and filling it up,

284
00:34:02,548 --> 00:34:05,848
何を言うべきか分からなくて
not knowing what I should say.

285
00:34:06,048 --> 00:34:09,248
感じてたものが遠く放たれていた
What I felt had been released far away,

286
00:34:09,548 --> 00:34:12,848
同じ様で違うんだ何だか心が
feeling the same yet somehow different,

287
00:34:13,048 --> 00:34:16,248
何時まで行こうか 何処まで行けるのか
wonders how long to go, how far I can reach,

288
00:34:16,548 --> 00:34:20,248
定かじゃないなら何を想うの
if nothing is certain, what am I thinking?

289
00:34:20,548 --> 00:34:24,048
僕らが離れるなら 僕らが迷うなら
If we are going to part ways, if we are going to get lost,

290
00:34:24,548 --> 00:34:27,548
その度に何回も繋がれる様に
so we can connect time and time again,

291
00:34:27,848 --> 00:34:31,548
ここに居てくれるなら 離さずいられたら
if you're going to stay here with me, if we could hold onto each other,

292
00:34:32,048 --> 00:34:47,048
VERY EXPECTED TO BE HERE

293
00:34:48,548 --> 00:34:52,048
平穏とは消耗を以て 代わりに成す
Tranquility is achieved through exhaustion in exchange,

294
00:34:52,248 --> 00:34:55,548
実際はどうも変わりはなく
in reality nothing much has changed,

295
00:34:55,848 --> 00:34:59,548
享楽とは嘘で成る
and pleasure is born from lies.

296
00:35:00,206 --> 00:35:03,506
都合の良い願いを
Wishing for a convenient prayer...

297
00:35:03,706 --> 00:35:08,906
同じように同じように呟く
Whispering the same way, the same way...

298
00:35:09,206 --> 00:35:15,906
どこから聞こうか 何を見失うか 定かじゃないなら此処を動けない
Where should we listen from? What are we losing sight of? Since it's uncertain, we can't move from here.

299
00:35:16,506 --> 00:35:23,706
僕らが疲れるなら これ以上無いなら その度に何回も逃げ出せるように
If we get tired, if there's nothing more than this, so we can escape time and time again...

300
00:35:24,006 --> 00:35:32,506
心が守れるように 奪われないように 互いに託して身体を預けてよ
So our hearts can be protected, so they won't be stolen, entrust each other and surrender your body...

301
00:35:46,606 --> 00:35:52,506
君と泣く 君と笑う 君と怒る
Crying with you, laughing with you, getting angry with you...

302
00:35:54,056 --> 00:36:00,306
君と歌う 君と踊る 君と話す
Singing with you, dancing with you, talking with you...

303
00:36:00,806 --> 00:36:07,006
いつまで続くだろうと 同じように同じように呟く
Wondering how long this will last, whispering the same way, the same way...

304
00:36:07,206 --> 00:36:14,506
いま忘れないよう刻まれた空気を これから何度思い出すのだろう
So we won't forget now, the carved air—we'll probably remember it many times from now on.

305
00:36:15,206 --> 00:36:23,306
僕らが離れるなら 僕らが迷うなら その度に何回も繋がれるように
If we drift apart, if we lose our way, so we can connect time and time again each time...

306
00:36:23,606 --> 00:36:31,306
ここに居てくれるなら 離さずいられたら まだ誰も知らない感覚で 僕の生きているすべてを
If you're here with me, if we could stay without letting go, with a feeling no one knows yet, verifying everything of my living...

307
00:36:31,506 --> 00:36:35,906
確かめて正しくして
...making sure it's right.

308
00:36:36,306 --> 00:36:51,056
Very expected, we are...

309
00:36:58,256 --> 00:37:04,156
悩める人の子よ 人成らざる者も 弛まず目指せよ
Troubled children of humanity, and non-human beings too—strive on tirelessly!

310
00:37:04,356 --> 00:37:11,156
目を逸らした過去も 退屈な未来も カウンセリング
Counseling for the averted past and the boring future...

311
00:37:12,356 --> 00:37:18,556
アンデッド！
UNDEAD!

312
00:37:24,206 --> 00:37:30,206
何だかどうして 戦っているようなそんな気がするの
Hey, somehow why does it feel like we're fighting?

313
00:37:31,106 --> 00:37:38,306
もうとっくに死んでる 透明な亡霊と対決 幼気で痛い記憶の奥
Confronting a transparent ghost that died long ago, deep inside innocent yet painful memories...

314
00:37:38,606 --> 00:37:45,606
残念？ もう居ないのに あれ？ そっちが良い？ アイロニーね 透かされているのは現在の自分？
Too bad? Even though you're no longer here. Oh? You prefer that? Such irony. Is my current self being seen through?

315
00:37:46,106 --> 00:37:54,206
ナンセンス 消えないレッテル 要はコンプレックス 取り憑かれているみたい 巻き付いたまま まだ離れない
Nonsense, an undying label. Yes! In short, it's a complex. It's like being haunted, still wrapped around and won't let go.

316
00:37:54,506 --> 00:37:57,206
在りし日の自分
My former self...

317
00:37:57,406 --> 00:38:04,506
アンデッド！ 死んじゃいない お前とお前の連鎖 生きていることとは変わり続けることだ
UNDEAD! We're not dead, the chain between you and you—living means continuing to change.

318
00:38:04,706 --> 00:38:10,906
不幸に甘んじて 満足するなよ 幸せになろうとしないなんて卑怯だ
Don't just settle for misfortune and be satisfied! Refusing to even try and be happy is cowardly.

319
00:38:11,306 --> 00:38:18,306
この世この世は奇怪奇怪ファンタジー 次は鬼が出るか蛇が出るか
This world, this world is a bizarre, bizarre fantasy—will an ogre appear next, or a snake?

320
00:38:18,506 --> 00:38:25,106
出会って遭ってやっと始まる物語 さあ人か化物か
Meeting, meeting, the story finally begins—come on, are we human or monsters?

321
00:38:25,406 --> 00:38:31,806
Past and future can't change the past

322
00:38:32,206 --> 00:38:39,206
何だかどうして 未来になんぞ 何の希望もない期待出来ないような気がして
Somehow, why does it feel like there's no hope or expectation for the future?

323
00:38:39,406 --> 00:38:46,406
もう随分生きている 既視感とテンプレで食傷 素敵な出来事の気配もない
We've lived quite a long time, sick of déjà vu and cliches, not even a hint of wonderful events.

324
00:38:46,706 --> 00:38:52,306
残念 積んだ経験の因果 形骸化された神話と退屈な進化
Too bad, the karma of accumulated experience, fossilized myths and boring evolution...

325
00:38:52,506 --> 00:38:59,306
要は刺激が欲しいんだ 飽きちゃった 慣れちゃった
In short, we want stimulation—got bored, got used to it.

326
00:38:59,606 --> 00:39:06,506
吸い尽くして あれも これも どれも 同じ味がする
Sucking them dry—this, that, and everything else tastes the same.

327
00:39:06,706 --> 00:39:14,306
何時の世も過去も未来も現在にあるんだ 生きていることを 愚直に果たせよ
Past, future, and every era exist right now—faithfully fulfill the fact that you're alive!

328
00:39:14,606 --> 00:39:21,206
目指せハッピーエンド アンデッド！ 死んじゃいない お前に言っているんだ
Aim for a happy ending! UNDEAD! We're not dead, I'm telling you!

329
00:39:21,406 --> 00:39:31,106
幸せを諦めてしまうな 人で在れ ただ苦しみに慣れて耐えているだけじゃ 死んでいるも同然 屍のアンデッド
Don't give up on happiness, remain human. Merely enduring while getting used to suffering is practically being dead, a corpse UNDEAD!

330
00:39:31,306 --> 00:39:38,306
悩める人の子よ 人成らざる者も
Troubled children of humanity, non-human beings too...

331
00:39:38,506 --> 00:39:46,306
不幸に浸るも 幸せになるのも そう全部全部お前だ 古今東西 一切合切 森羅万象 ピースピース
Drowning in misfortune, or becoming happy—yes, it's all, all you. East and west, past and present, everything, all creation, peace peace!

332
00:39:46,606 --> 00:39:52,606
Past and future can't change the past

333
00:39:52,906 --> 00:39:59,956
人の在る所に何時も憂い事 生き抜けこの化物ばかりの物語
Where people exist, there are always worries—survive this story full of monsters!

334
00:40:46,914 --> 00:40:52,264
感情なんてもんはどうしても無駄だって悪魔は言った「何もかも捨てちまえよ」
No matter the time, emotions are a nuisance, the devil said. "Throw everything away."

335
00:40:52,964 --> 00:41:00,064
嗚呼、快不快も、喜怒哀楽さえも！どうしようもない事実、ヒトは終焉から逃れられない
Ah, even pleasure and displeasure, and even all emotions! Inevitable fact, humans cannot escape their end.

336
00:41:00,564 --> 00:41:05,564
「誰も抗えない欲望に従え」思考を休めるな 脳ミソを回せ
"Submit to desires no one can resist." Don't rest your thoughts, spin your brain.

337
00:41:06,564 --> 00:41:09,564
「誰もお前のことなど見ちゃいないさ」
"Nobody is even looking at you anyway."

338
00:41:10,064 --> 00:41:13,064
おかしくなってしまうことをどうして恥じる？
Why be ashamed of going crazy?

339
00:41:14,064 --> 00:41:21,064
お前らに完璧で間違った踊り方を教えてやるから いっせーので捨てちまえ、そんな命ならば
I'll teach you a perfect yet wrong way to dance, so throw away that kind of life all at once.

340
00:41:23,064 --> 00:41:30,564
何十何百何千何万回学習しなさいな どうしたってさ、空っぽの頭蓋骨だろ
Study it tens, hundreds, thousands, tens of thousands of times. After all, it's an empty skull.

341
00:41:52,564 --> 00:41:57,064
感情なんていつ何時でも邪魔だって悪魔は言った
No matter the time, emotions are a nuisance, the devil said.

342
00:41:57,564 --> 00:42:05,564
「反論の余地などない」嗚呼、人生に意味を与えておくれ！420でさえも救えない終焉があると知った
"There is no room for argument." Ah, please give meaning to life! I realized there's an end even 420 can't save.

343
00:42:06,064 --> 00:42:10,564
「誰も疑わない神様を疑え」思考を休めるな 脳ミソを回せ
"Doubt the God nobody doubts." Don't rest your thoughts, spin your brain.

344
00:42:11,064 --> 00:42:15,064
「誰もお前のことなど見ちゃいないさ」
"Nobody is even looking at you anyway."

345
00:42:15,564 --> 00:42:18,564
躊躇っている数秒の無益さを知れ
Realize the futility of those few seconds of hesitation.

346
00:42:19,564 --> 00:42:28,064
お前らに完璧で間違った踊り方を教えてやるから いっせーので捨てちまえ、そんな命ならば
I'll teach you a perfect yet wrong way to dance, so throw away that kind of life all at once.

347
00:42:29,064 --> 00:42:37,064
何十何百何千何万回学習しなさいな どうしたってさ、頭ん中空っぽなこと わかっていないようだ
Study it tens, hundreds, thousands, tens of thousands of times. It seems you don't understand that your head is completely empty after all.

348
00:42:47,064 --> 00:42:51,564
承認欲にレイプされ、死んだ花をぶら下げている女
A woman carrying dead flowers, raped by the desire for recognition.

349
00:42:52,064 --> 00:42:56,564
何かを愛すことすら、ままならないまま餌を待つだけ
Just waiting for bait, unable even to love anything.

350
00:42:57,064 --> 00:43:04,064
踊り方を知らない、芸術の価値などわからないやつらに 堕落していれば 何も見えないまま
Among those who don't know how to dance and don't understand the worth of art, wallowing in depravity so you see nothing at all.

351
00:43:07,064 --> 00:43:13,064
真善美に背いた踊り方を教えてやるから いっせーので狂っちまえ、惨めな姿で
I'll teach you a dance defying truth, goodness, and beauty, so go mad all at once in a miserable figure.

352
00:43:16,064 --> 00:43:25,064
何十何百何千何万何億人の中でさぁ、そうして埋もれていたっていいと どうして言えるのだろう？
Among tens, hundreds, thousands, tens of thousands, hundreds of millions of people, how can you say it's fine to be buried like that?

353
00:43:27,064 --> 00:43:34,064
世界が患っている狂信は 健常者でさえ目が眩むような光を放っている
The fanaticism afflicting the world radiates a light that dazzles even the healthy.

354
00:43:35,064 --> 00:43:41,064
今夜、悪魔がお前らにこう云うぜ「神とやらに惑わされるなよ」
Tonight, the devil tells you: "Don't be misled by the likes of gods."

355
00:44:17,396 --> 00:44:18,796
はぁーい！
Hiiii!

356
00:44:19,066 --> 00:44:23,866
悪魔の踊り方、歌わせていただきましたぁ！
I just sang 'Akuma no Odorikata'!

357
00:44:24,186 --> 00:44:29,566
悪魔の踊り方ってさ、すごいかっこいい曲じゃん？
'Akuma no Odorikata' is such a cool song, right?

358
00:44:29,866 --> 00:44:37,586
あいうかっこいい歌歌うと、なんかちゃんとサマになっているのかなって、なんかこう、心細い気持ちに実はなってるんだよね。
When I sing such a cool song, I actually feel a bit insecure, wondering if I'm pulling it off properly.

359
00:44:37,886 --> 00:44:41,686
ちゃんとかっこよく歌えてたかな、ぼく。
I wonder if I sang it really coolly.

360
00:44:45,086 --> 00:44:50,086
ということでね、なんかもうここまでもうあっという間だったよね。
So anyway, man, up to this point it's really gone by in a flash, hasn't it?

361
00:44:50,386 --> 00:44:59,964
もうそんな時間経ってるんだっていう感じでございますが、なんとですね、ここから告知タイムとさせていただきます。
It feels like so much time has already passed, but guess what, we're going to move on to the announcement time from here.

362
00:45:15,072 --> 00:45:23,072
ここからは檜山修之が猫又おかゆ誕生日記念グッズ2026をご紹介するぞ！まずはこれだ！
From here on, I, Nobuyuki Hiyama, will introduce Nekomata Okayu's Birthday Goods 2026! First is this!

363
00:45:23,572 --> 00:45:26,572
[Title: はっぴ～おかゆはっぴ]
[Title: Happy Okayu Happi]

364
00:45:27,072 --> 00:45:31,572
神岡ちろる先生の描き下ろしイラストが描かれた法被がグッズになったぞ。
A happi coat featuring a brand-new illustration by Chiroru Kamioka-sensei has been made into merchandise.

365
00:45:32,072 --> 00:45:41,072
きょとん顔のおかゆんがとてもキュート！イベントやライブに着ていけば、一目でのおにぎりゃアピールできるスーパーハッピーなグッズだ！！
Okayu-n with her blank expression is so cute! Wear it to events or live shows to easily show off your Onigiriya pride as a super happy item!!

366
00:45:42,072 --> 00:45:45,572
[Title: お出かけに連れてってアクリルスタンド]
[Title: Take-Along Acrylic Stand]

367
00:45:46,072 --> 00:45:52,072
アクスタはもう家に飾るだけの時代じゃない！日々のお出かけを彩る、推し活マストアイテム。
Acrylic stands are no longer just for displaying at home! A must-have Oshi-katsu item to color your daily outings.

368
00:45:52,572 --> 00:45:58,572
ポーチに入れて外に持ち運んで、おかゆんに世界を沢山見せてあげてくれよな！
Put it in a pouch and carry it outside, and show Okayu-n a lot of the world!

369
00:45:59,072 --> 00:46:02,572
[Title: ごくごく！BIGたんぷら～]
[Title: Gulp Gulp! BIG Tumbler]

370
00:46:03,072 --> 00:46:07,572
甘城なつき先生描き下ろしのミニキャラが描かれた大容量のタンブラー。
A large-capacity tumbler featuring newly drawn mini-chibi characters by Natsuki Amashiro-sensei.

371
00:46:08,072 --> 00:46:19,072
持ち手やストローもついているので、外出時はもちろん、勉強中や仕事中、様々なシチュエーションで大活躍間違いなし！おかゆんの配信を見る時にも使ってくれ！！
With a handle and straw, it's guaranteed to be a huge hit when going out, studying, working, or even watching Okayu-n's streams!!

372
00:46:20,072 --> 00:46:23,072
[Title: おでかけおにぎり型ショルダーポーチ！]
[Title: Outing Onigiri-Shaped Shoulder Pouch!]

373
00:46:24,072 --> 00:46:32,072
アクスタやhololive friends to Goなどちょっとした小物が入る優れたショルダーポーチだぜ。透明素材なので日々の推し活に使える一品となっているぞ！
An excellent shoulder pouch that fits small items like acrylic stands or hololive friends to Go. Made of transparent material, it's a staple for your daily Oshi-katsu!

374
00:46:33,072 --> 00:46:35,572
そして…フルセット購入特典はこちら！
And... here is the full-set purchase bonus!

375
00:46:36,072 --> 00:46:44,072
なんとフルセットを購入した全員に、猫又おかゆ直筆サイン＆複製メッセージ入りポストカードがついてくる！
Everyone who purchases the full set will receive a postcard with Nekomata Okayu's handwritten signature and replicated message!

376
00:46:45,072 --> 00:46:48,572
おにぎりゃの皆、絶対ゲットしてくれよな！
Onigiriya, make sure to get yours!

377
00:46:49,572 --> 00:46:53,072
よっしゃーー！
Alright!

378
00:46:54,072 --> 00:47:04,572
ということで、あの桧山修之さんに生誕グッズのCMを撮っていただきましたー！やったーー！
So, Hiyama Nobuyuki-san recorded the commercial for my birthday goods! Yay!

379
00:47:05,072 --> 00:47:11,572
お桧山修之さんというね、あのレジェンドの声優さんがいらっしゃって、
Hiyama Nobuyuki-san is such a legendary voice actor,

380
00:47:11,572 --> 00:47:17,072
猫又おかゆホロライブデビュー時からの世界で一番大好きな声優さんとなっております。
and he has become my absolute favorite voice actor in the world since my Hololive debut!

381
00:47:20,072 --> 00:47:26,072
あのこの場をお借りして、あの桧山修之さん本当にありがとうございました！
I'd like to take this moment to sincerely thank Hiyama Nobuyuki-san!

382
00:47:30,072 --> 00:47:32,572
ちょっ…興奮冷めやらぬなんですけど！
Phew... I'm still so excited right now!

383
00:47:33,072 --> 00:47:44,072
あのCMにあったとおり、猫又おかゆ生誕グッズ2026を発売させていただきますので、皆さんぜひこよなくお待ちしてます！
As shown in the commercial, Nekomata Okayu Birthday Goods 2026 will be released, so everyone please look forward to it!

384
00:47:48,072 --> 00:47:51,572
そして、告知は1つだけじゃないんですねえ。
And that's not the only announcement!

385
00:47:52,072 --> 00:47:55,572
続きまして、こちら！どうぞ！
Next up is this! Here you go!

386
00:47:56,072 --> 00:48:03,072
[Title: キミの彼女は…猫又おかゆ！？ おかゆにゅ～～む！-R- 2026.3.26 Release]
[Title: Is Your Girlfriend... Nekomata Okayu!? Okayunyumu! -R- Releasing March 26, 2026]

387
00:48:04,072 --> 00:48:17,072
おかゆにゅ～～む！Rがリリース！
Okayunyumu! R is releasing!

388
00:48:18,072 --> 00:48:26,072
青森を舞台に君と二人で商品開発という名の恋人旅行がスタート！
Set in Aomori, a romantic trip disguised as product development with you begins!

389
00:48:27,072 --> 00:48:30,072
笑いあり、デートあり、
Full of laughs, dates,

390
00:48:30,072 --> 00:48:32,072
野球拳もあり、
rock-paper-scissors games,

391
00:48:32,572 --> 00:48:35,572
うん、もりだくさんの作品となっております！
and so much more packed into this title!

392
00:48:36,072 --> 00:48:49,072
じ、自分で…自分、そう、野球拳、あ、ありって何って、おもちゃだね！自分で言っとくせにね、僕が野球拳ありって言いたくせにね
Wait, me... myself, right, rock-paper-scissors... wait, what do you mean 'yes'? That's a toy! Even though I was the one who suggested it, I was the one who wanted rock-paper-scissors in it.

393
00:48:49,572 --> 00:48:57,072
そして、おかゆにゅ～～む！のセロ審査大丈夫なのかよというお声、あのたびたびいただいておりますが、
And I've often received questions like 'Is Okayunyumu!'s CERO rating really going to be okay?'

394
00:48:57,072 --> 00:49:05,072
なんと、心配していたセロ審査も無事…Cーーー！！で、決まりました！
Well, the CERO rating we were worried about has safely been decided as... C! Yay!

395
00:49:06,072 --> 00:49:14,072
ふう、よかったよかった。うん。そして、みんな体験版ももうすでに遊んでくれたかな？
Phew, I'm so glad. Yeah. And have you all played the trial version already?

396
00:49:15,072 --> 00:49:29,072
あのドキドキの続きは、ぜひ君の目で確かめてほしいな。まだまだたくさんの未公開情報もあるとのことなので、おかゆにゅ～～む！Rから目が離せないよ！
I hope you'll experience the rest of that excitement with your own eyes. There's still plenty of unreleased info to come, so you won't be able to take your eyes off Okayunyumu! R!

397
00:49:29,572 --> 00:49:33,572
ぜひ、お楽しみに！
Please look forward to it!

398
00:49:34,072 --> 00:49:39,072
そして、こちらは最後の告知となります！
And now, for our final announcement!

399
00:49:39,572 --> 00:49:51,572
毎年発表させていただいているんですが、今日もライブの最後に新曲を発表させていただきます！やったーーー！！
As I announce every year, I'll be premiering a brand-new song at the very end of today's live as well! Yayyy!!

400
00:49:51,572 --> 00:49:59,072
今回はですね、てにをはさんに作詞作曲をしていただけました！ありがとうございます、てにをはさん！
This time, Teniwoha-san wrote the lyrics and composed the music for us! Thank you so much, Teniwoha-san!

401
00:50:00,523 --> 00:50:04,673
ではでは、あの色々言いたいこととかもあるんですが、
Now then, I have various things I want to say, but...

402
00:50:04,973 --> 00:50:11,933
まずは君の目でしっかりと聞いていただければなと、見ていただければなと思っております。
first, I hope you'll listen closely with your own eyes... I mean, watch closely.

403
00:50:12,833 --> 00:50:20,253
ではでは…聞いてください。「ノンデリシャス」
Now then... please listen. "Non Delicious"

404
00:50:33,762 --> 00:50:40,502
今日も噛む噛む 1 2 3 舌も踊るよ 1 2 3
Today I'm chomping and chewing, one, two, three / My tongue's dancing too, one, two, three

405
00:50:40,952 --> 00:50:49,882
トラウマをじっくり煮込んだボルシチどうぞ キミの心臓は歯形だらけさ
Please enjoy this borscht slow-cooked with trauma / Your heart is covered in bite marks

406
00:50:57,732 --> 00:51:04,032
苦肉のステーキとセルフィッシュ&チップス マンネリを刻んだサラダ
A steak born of desperation, selfish & chips, and a salad chopped out of boredom

407
00:51:04,452 --> 00:51:12,392
こんなにもおいしい食卓 邪魔しないで お口を開けて はい あーん
Don't get in the way of such a delicious dining table / Open your mouth, yes, say ah

408
00:51:13,332 --> 00:51:19,612
ウェイター！ ウェイター！ お皿を下げないで これがボクの“おいしいモノ”なんだから
Waiter! Waiter! Don't clear the plates / Because this is my "delicious thing" after all

409
00:51:20,102 --> 00:51:27,502
ハングリーロンリーグラトニー 新しいメニュー みんなクワイエットクワイエット おまちかね
Hungry, lonely, gluttonous, a new menu / Everyone, quiet, quiet, waiting for this

410
00:51:27,992 --> 00:51:35,422
デリシャス ノンデリシャス
Delicious, non-delicious

411
00:51:36,252 --> 00:51:44,552
そんなテリブル・テーブル 蹴っ飛ばして エブリデイエブリナイトがっつかないで ノンデリシャス なんべんだっておかわり
Kick away such a terrible table / Don't devour every single day and night / Non-delicious / Have seconds however many times you want

412
00:51:52,402 --> 00:51:59,512
お皿積み上げ 3 4 5 バベルみたいに 3 4 5
Stacking plates 3, 4, 5, like the Tower of Babel 3, 4, 5

413
00:52:00,042 --> 00:52:08,412
喉の奥につっかえて窒息しかけても 大人は飲み込むらしい すっごいね
Even if it gets stuck in my throat and I almost suffocate / Adults apparently just swallow it down, amazing

414
00:52:10,672 --> 00:52:16,972
二枚舌のソテー 義理人情サンドイッチ 情熱の冷めたスープ
Two-faced sauté, duty-and-humanity sandwich, cooled-down passion soup

415
00:52:17,452 --> 00:52:24,552
そんなもの頼んでないから ボクはボクで好きなものだけ食べるだけ
I didn't order anything like that, so I'll just eat what I like as myself

416
00:52:25,342 --> 00:52:32,562
飢えた！ 飢えた！ 際限なく持ってきて これがボクの“おいしい日々”なんだから
Starved! Starved! Bring it endlessly / Because this is my "delicious daily life"

417
00:52:33,042 --> 00:52:40,482
異論反論諸々飲み込んだ後で 挑めダイエットダイエット
After swallowing various objections and counterarguments / Challenge yourself to diet, diet

418
00:52:41,052 --> 00:52:44,882
一心不乱に噛む噛む 不条理を噛む
Chomping and chewing single-mindedly, chewing on the absurd

419
00:52:45,472 --> 00:52:52,702
のらりくらり 幸せそうな顔して 噛む噛む あくまで噛む
Floating along with a happy expression / Chomping and chewing, chewing to the bitter end

420
00:52:53,132 --> 00:53:00,702
みんなクワイエットクワイエット おまちかね デリシャス ノンデリシャス
Everyone, quiet, quiet, waiting for this / Delicious, non-delicious

421
00:53:04,302 --> 00:53:13,412
そんなテリブル・テーブル 蹴っ飛ばして エブリデイエブリナイトがっつかないで ノンデリシャス なんべんだっておかわりしよ
Kick away such a terrible table / Don't devour every single day and night / Non-delicious / Let's have seconds however many times you want!

422
00:56:14,223 --> 00:56:25,224
[Text: おにぎり〜ん!! 今日は お祝いしてくれて ほんとにありがとぅ✨💜 毎日がハッピーなのもみんなのおかげで ずっ〜と一緒に行きたいネ… ちょっとでも会える現実の きっかけになれますように… 猫又おかゆ]
[Text: Onigiriya~! Thank you so much for celebrating with me today✨💜 Everyday is happy all thanks to you guys, I want to stay together forever... I hope this can become a real chance for us to meet, even just a little... Nekomata Okayu]

